<title>TURKEY: Turk Iktisat Bank secures 70 mln mark synd loan.</title>
<headline>Turk Iktisat Bank secures 70 mln mark synd loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's medium-sized Iktisat Bank said on Friday it secured a 70 million mark syndication loan from an international banking consortium for use in foreign trade finance.</p>
<p>Iktisat said in a statement that the loan exceeded an initial 50 million mark mandate due to oversubscription and Sumitomo Bank, Baden Wurttembergsche Bank and Baca CRT were arrangers.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875. EKS</p>
